    {
      "id": "s5",
      "concept": "Combination formula",
      "narration": "Combination formula is used when order does not matter. It is written as C(n,r) = n! / [r! (n-r)!]. For example, choosing 2 items from 5 is C(5,2) = 5! / [2! (5-2)!] = 10.",
